tment company, which is known as a PFIC, for any taxable year if, for such year, either","context":"If we are classified as a passive foreign investment company, United States taxpayers who own our securities may have adverse United States federal income tax consequences.","section":"●If the integrated entities do not meet their projected revenue targets, or if integration expenses exceed our estimates, our liquidity and results of operations may be adversely affected.","block":319,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-001449","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-21","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001985337","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1985337/000118518526001449/yygh20f123125.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/b340888d63c990cc9d936271dc04a66f4e0abd6d1810e8ab93ee7464f99e0221.bin","sha256":"b340888d63c990cc9d936271dc04a66f4e0abd6d1810e8ab93ee7464f99e0221"}},{"id":"f35149d3ea059099b9edce3b5f82e0344b9556944377acd9fa80bd3afd9072ff","quote":"●At least 75% of our gross income for the year is passive income; or","context":"We are a non-U.S. corporation and, as such, we will be classified as a passive foreign investment company, which is known as a PFIC, for any taxable year if, for such year, either","section":"●If the integrated entities do not meet their projected revenue targets, or if integration expenses exceed our estimates, our liquidity and results of operations may be adversely affected.","block":320,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001185185-26-001449","form":"20-F","filedAt":"2026-04-21","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001985337","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1985337/000118518526001449/yygh20f123125.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/b340888d63c990cc9d936271dc04a66f4e0abd6d1810e8ab93ee7464f99e0221.bin","sha256":"b340888d63c990cc9d936271dc04a66f4e0abd6d1810e8ab